direction: down

flag: Explicit --config path
discovery: Upward search from the working directory
viteplus: Vite plus config forwarding
session: One session loads the config once
overrides: Per-file overrides and ignore patterns
batch: Every file in the batch reuses the session
loud: Unsupported keys fail loudly

flag -> session
discovery -> session
viteplus -> session
session -> overrides -> batch
session -> loud
